-01-28T22:13:24Z"},"body":"This PR delegates from `Input` to the `DisplayServer` the task of handling `mouse_mode` and its override. (it was more or less the behavior before #97257)\r\n\r\n`Input` was caching the result of `mouse_mode`, expecting that setting the mouse mode was synchronous on all platforms. As it isn't on the Web, it created some issues.\r\n\r\nSee [the discussion](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/core?msg=bLJJC9vLjjtAH58kY) about the fix and why the mouse mode can't be cached and why we shouldn't make (for now) async handlers.\r\n\r\nThis PR also adds `MOUSE_MODE_MAX` and various index checks.\r\n\r\nFixes #100758\r\nSupersedes #101849","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101924/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101924/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}